outcome = SubResource("Resource_a6ufw")
markedup_result_text = "Each member of the expedition takes a turn to walk up to the statue and bow.

Somehow, the sheer strangeness of the creature fills them with an immense feeling of inspiration and the desire to go out into the world and create unique and beautiful things."

